<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Escorts Investment Bank issue flops.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Escorts Investment Bank issue flops.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Escorts Investment Bank Ltd's public issue of shares on August 25 received poor investor response, brokers said on Monday.</p>
<p>One broker said the 10-rupee shares were likely to open below par when they start trading in a few months' time.</p>
<p>The bank, which plans to provide long-term finance to the industrial and other sectors, said it had received 13 million rupees in subscription against an offer of shares worth 80 million rupees.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
